"d":"2019-02-21","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Craig Conti","x":"Seasonal power price increases and investments related to the Hawesville restart drove the majority of the remaining EBITDA decrease versus Q3.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/02/21/century-aluminum-company-cenx-q4-2018-earnings-con.aspx"},{"c":"CENX 2018 Q4","e":"cenx","d":"2019-02-21","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Craig Conti","x":"So we will see the favorable EBITDA impact of this cost reduction beginning in Q2 as Mike pointed out earlier.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/02/21/century-aluminum-company-cenx-q4-2018-earnings-con.aspx"},{"c":"CENX 2018 Q4","e":"cenx","d":"2019-02-21","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Craig Conti","x":"The cash cost reduction from Q1 to the back portion of 2019 is largely driven by the alumina cost reduction I mentioned earlier.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/02/21/century-aluminum-company-cenx-q4-2018-earnings-con.aspx"},{"c":"CENX 2019 Q2","e":"cenx","d":"2019-08-01","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Mike Bless","x":"As you're all very well aware, the U.S., Canada and Mexico reached an accommodation on the metal tariffs in mid-May.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/08/02/century-aluminum-cenx-q2-2019-earnings-call-transc.aspx"},{"c":"CENX 2019 Q2","e":"cenx","d":"2019-08-01","l":"tariffs","r":"analyst","s":"Paretosh Misra","x":"Just curious how you're thinking about it for the second half of this year particularly on the -- like what Section 232 duties are baked into that number?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/08/02/century-aluminum-cenx-q2-2019-earnings-call-transc.aspx"},{"c":"CENX 2019 Q4","e":"cenx","d":"2020-02-20","l":"tariffs","r":"analyst","s":"John Tumazos","x":"Was it just an inventory reversal after stocking with the tariffs in 2018, the orders should have been up?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/02/21/century-aluminum-cenx-q4-2019-earnings-call-transc.aspx"},{"c":"CENX 2020 Q1","e":"cenx","d":"2020-04-30","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Mike Bless","x":"The fall began very shortly after Canada was exempted from the Section 232 tariffs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/01/century-aluminum-cenx-q1-2020-earnings-call-transc.aspx"},{"c":"CENX 2020 Q1","e":"cenx","d":"2020-04-30","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Mike Bless","x":"And as you'll remember, at the time of the exemption, the parties agreed that the tariffs would go back into place if a surge were to occur and not to cease.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/01/century-aluminum-cenx-q1-2020-earnings-call-transc.aspx"},{"c":"CENX 2020 Q1","e":"cenx","d":"2020-04-30","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Mike Bless","x":"You'll also see that our cost structure resulted in excellent profit and in good cash flow conversion, and this was before the recent further cost-reduction actions that we put in, in March.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/01/century-aluminum-cenx-q1-2020-earnings-call-transc.aspx"},{"c":"CENX 2020 Q1","e":"cenx","d":"2020-04-30","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Mike Bless","x":"The decline in the price of these raw materials, combined with our recently implemented cost-reduction actions, have brought our cash breakeven level down to very near the current LME price.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/01/century-aluminum-cenx-q1-2020-earnings-call-transc.aspx"},{"c":"CENX 2020 Q4","e":"cenx","d":"2021-02-18","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Michael A. Bless","x":"As you'll recall, these amounts were specifically set to backstop the effectiveness of the Section 232 program.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/18/century-aluminum-company-cenx-q4-2020-earnings-cal/"},{"c":"CENX 2020 Q4","e":"cenx","d":"2021-02-18","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Michael A. Bless","x":"Most immediate action you've seen was the rollback of the previous administration's last minute exemption of a large importing country from the tariff.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/18/century-aluminum-company-cenx-q4-2020-earnings-cal/"},{"c":"CENX 2020 Q4","e":"cenx","d":"2021-02-18","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Paretosh Misra","x":"Is there any opportunity for you to pass through some of this high power cost to customers as such, some kind of power surcharge or is it just too early to think about that route.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/18/century-aluminum-company-cenx-q4-2020-earnings-cal/"},{"c":"CENX 2021 Q2","e":"cenx","d":"2021-08-04","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Jesse E. Gary","x":"…paired with supply disruptions caused by inclement weather and energy shortages in China, export tariffs in Russia and the recent announcement of production disruptions in Canada has led to an especially tight physical market in the U.S. and Europe, and provides significant near-term support to…","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/08/05/century-aluminum-cenx-q2-2021-earnings-call-transc/"},{"c":"CENX 2021 Q2","e":"cenx","d":"2021-08-04","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Jesse E. Gary","x":"The physical tightness is just another example of why domestic supply chains for key raw materials are imperative and why programs like Section 232 are so important to bring back domestic industries and jobs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/08/05/century-aluminum-cenx-q2-2021-earnings-call-transc/"},{"c":"CENX 2021 Q2","e":"cenx","d":"2021-08-04","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Jesse E. Gary","x":"In fact, since the Russian export tax was first announced on June 24th, the European Duty Paid premium prices -- price increases have actually outpaced Midwest price -- premium price increases at 40% for ABPT [Phonetic] to 20% for Midwest premium.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/08/05/century-aluminum-cenx-q2-2021-earnings-call-transc/"},{"c":"CENX 2021 Q3","e":"cenx","d":"2021-11-03","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Jesse E. Gary","x":"This physical tightness is just another example of why domestic supply chains for key raw materials are imperative and why programs like Section 232 are so important to bring back domestic industry and jobs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/11/04/century-aluminum-cenx-q3-2021-earnings-call-transc/"},{"c":"CENX 2021 Q3","e":"cenx","d":"2021-11-03","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Jesse E. Gary","x":"The Biden administration has continued to show its support of the Section 232 program for aluminum with its recent agreement with the EU to implement a tariff rate quota on all primary aluminum imports from the EU to the U.S. Under the new agreement, a tariff rate of 10% will continue to apply to…","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/11/04/century-aluminum-cenx-q3-2021-earnings-call-transc/"},{"c":"CENX 2021 Q3","e":"cenx","d":"2021-11-03","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Jesse E. Gary","x":"On the raw materials side, we've recently seen price increases in alumina, mainly driven by supply curtailments in China and a fire in the Jamalco alumina refinery in Jamaica.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/11/04/century-aluminum-cenx-q3-2021-earnings-call-transc/"},{"c":"CENX 2021 Q3","e":"cenx","d":"2021-11-03","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Jesse E. Gary","x":"While we're monitoring the situation closely, we believe we are well situated to pass along the majority of any price increase associated with the shortage and have sufficient supply on hand to meet our needs well into next year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/11/04/century-aluminum-cenx-q3-2021-earnings-call-transc/"},{"c":"CENX 2026 Q1","e":"cenx","d":"2026-05-07","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Jesse Gary","x":"In the U.S. specifically, we are already beginning to see increased value-added product demand following President Trump's April 2 executive order that closed valuation loopholes that importers have been using to cheat the Section 232 system, especially in downstream extruded products.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/08/cenx-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"CENX 2026 Q1","e":"cenx","d":"2026-05-07","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Jesse Gary","x":"And thanks to President Trump's leadership and the Section 232 program, we plan to invest billions more in new and expanded production at Mt.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/08/cenx-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"CENX 2026 Q1","e":"cenx","d":"2026-05-07","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Peter Trpkovski","x":"This benefit is partially offset by heavy fuel oil prices that have risen with the broader oil price increase since the Middle East conflict started.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/08/cenx-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"CENX 2026 Q2","e":"cenx","d":"2026-08-06","l":"tariffs","r":"analyst","s":"Jesse E. Gary","x":"Under the program, approved companies will be able to annually import primary aluminum up to the amount of the new production they are building at a reduced tariff rate of 25%.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/13/century-aluminum-cenx-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"CENX 2026 Q2","e":"cenx","d":"2026-08-06","l":"tariffs","r":"analyst","s":"Jesse E. Gary","x":"Taken together, a balance sheet where our cash now exceeds our total debt the tariff benefit under the new executive order, and the value we have created at Hawesville.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/13/century-aluminum-cenx-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"